{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>《QR Workshop Full》是一款離線 QR 碼與條碼掃描、建立工具，適合需要安全檢查連結、製作 Wi-Fi 或付款碼，以及打印標籤的用戶。原價 US $0.99，現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，主打無廣告、無帳戶，所有編碼在裝置本機處理。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-269.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>安全掃描與多格式建立</h2>\n<p>掃描時可使用相機或匯入相片、截圖與 PDF，支援同一圖像內多個碼，並在開啟前顯示完整網址及風險提示，連結不會自動打開。建立功能涵蓋 QR 碼、Wi-Fi、聯絡人、付款與 GS1 標籤，亦可產生多種條碼並校驗檢查碼；可加入顏色、圓點與標誌，再以 PNG 或 PDF 分享或打印。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-341-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-342-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-343-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-344-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-345-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：QR Workshop Full: Scanner</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/qr-workshop-full-scanner/id6824655492?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T12:43:56.934543+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":329,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T12:31:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T15:57:29.602889+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T12:37:28.198516+00:00","content_hash":"e9970bab764f7b07734798525427855b55aaff907b283029e3820c07e44cb024","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}